%% Sequence — Hotfix auto-create + merge-back, blueprint C.9.1 / J.4
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Dev as Developer
  participant API as helm-api (Hotfix)
  participant HS as HotfixService
  participant REG as ProviderRegistry
  participant GH as GitHubAdapter
  participant DB as PostgreSQL (tx + outbox)
  participant BUS as Event Bus

  Dev->>API: POST /hotfixes {repo, base_channel: production, title}
  API->>API: PermissionGuard: hotfix.create?
  API->>HS: createHotfix(ctx, dto)
  HS->>DB: find production ServiceVersion (tag + sha)
  HS->>REG: for("github")
  REG-->>HS: GitHubAdapter
  HS->>GH: createBranch(hotfix/x.y.z-fix, fromSha=prod tag)
  HS->>DB: BEGIN
  HS->>DB: INSERT work_item(type=hotfix, priority=critical)
  HS->>DB: compute merge-back targets = main + all active release/*
  HS->>DB: INSERT outbox(hotfix.created {mergeBackTargets})
  HS->>DB: COMMIT
  HS-->>API: {workItem, hotfixBranch, mergeBackTargets}
  API-->>Dev: 201 Created
  Note over HS,GH: completeHotfix() later opens + merges PRs into<br/>main AND every active release/* (no fix lost)
  BUS-->>BUS: hotfix.created → notify + audit
